#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md
msgid "Topic summary"
msgstr "Resum del tema"

#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md:10
msgid ""
"Profile facts, transactions, calculations, filings and evidence live "
"primarily in bucket-scoped encrypted SQL secure objects. Registered "
"namespaces define sensitivity, schema and custody policy. AES-GCM binds "
"ciphertext to namespace/key/schema; HMAC keys hide natural identifiers; "
"revision-guarded batches and parent checks keep related records "
"consistent. A plaintext transaction-date routing index exposes date/ID "
"metadata but falls back to encrypted scan if incomplete. [Full synthesis"
"](persistence-and-secure-storage.md), write funnel "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/sql/_secure_object_writes.py`),"
" date fallback "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/transactions.py`), "
"[detail](../articles/019-profile-persistence-for-transactions-review-"
"exchange-and-workflows.md), [detail](../articles/025-encrypted-sql-"
"repository-revision-writes-and-workflow-storage.md)."
msgstr ""
"Les dades del perfil, les transaccions, els càlculs, les presentacions i "
"les evidències resideixen principalment en objectes segurs SQL xifrats "
"delimitats al contenidor. Els espais de noms registrats defineixen la "
"sensibilitat, l’esquema i la política de custòdia. AES-GCM vincula el "
"text xifrat a l’espai de noms, la clau i l’esquema; les claus HMAC "
"amaguen els identificadors naturals; els lots protegits per revisió i les"
" comprovacions de pares mantenen coherents els registres relacionats. Un "
"índex d’encaminament de dates de transacció en text pla exposa metadades "
"de dates i identificadors, però recorre a un escaneig xifrat si és "
"incomplet. [Síntesi completa](persistence-and-secure-storage.md), "
"conducte d’escriptura "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/sql/_secure_object_writes.py`),"
" alternativa de dates "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/transactions.py`), "
"[detall](../articles/019-profile-persistence-for-transactions-review-"
"exchange-and-workflows.md), [detall](../articles/025-encrypted-sql-"
"repository-revision-writes-and-workflow-storage.md)."

#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md:12
msgid ""
"Profile DEKs are password/recovery wrapped, sentinel-proven and housed in"
" no-replace published capsules; KDF work runs in a bounded supervised "
"child. Session acceleration splits an OS-keychain random key from an "
"encrypted receipt. Automation credentials use native stores and durable "
"denial intents. Attachments and archives retain encrypted bytes with "
"digest checks. An operation journal validates ordered history and exact "
"lease ownership; consent history appends before off-host evidence "
"dispatch without retaining document bytes. Capsule "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/capsule.py`), "
"acceleration "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/acceleration_receipt.py`),"
" consent ledger "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/llm/consent_ledger.py`), "
"[detail](../articles/017-persistence-for-llm-records-durable-operations-"
"and-profile-state.md), [detail](../articles/021-supervised-key-"
"derivation-and-automation-custody.md), [detail](../articles/022-profile-"
"capsule-lifecycle-and-custody-proof.md)."
msgstr ""
"Les DEK dels perfils estan embolcallades amb contrasenya o recuperació, "
"acreditades per un sentinella i allotjades en càpsules publicades sense "
"substitució; el treball KDF s’executa en un procés fill supervisat i "
"delimitat. L’acceleració de sessió separa una clau aleatòria del clauer "
"del sistema operatiu d’un rebut xifrat. Les credencials d’automatització "
"utilitzen magatzems natius i intencions duradores de denegació. Els "
"adjunts i arxius conserven bytes xifrats amb comprovacions d’empremta. Un"
" diari d’operacions valida l’historial ordenat i la titularitat exacta de"
" l’arrendament; l’historial de consentiment afegeix entrades abans de "
"l’enviament d’evidències fora de l’amfitrió sense conservar els bytes "
"dels documents. Càpsula "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/capsule.py`), "
"acceleració "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/acceleration_receipt.py`),"
" llibre de consentiment "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/llm/consent_ledger.py`), "
"[detall](../articles/017-persistence-for-llm-records-durable-operations-"
"and-profile-state.md), [detall](../articles/021-supervised-key-"
"derivation-and-automation-custody.md), [detall](../articles/022-profile-"
"capsule-lifecycle-and-custody-proof.md)."

#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md:14
msgid ""
"Scoped risks include direct in-place financial checkpoint writes, a "
"potentially racing attachment manifest read/merge/write, database content"
" omitted from deletion-inventory digests, and outer review-package "
"metadata absent from this adapter's AEAD associated data pending "
"signature tracing. SQL revision hashes are unkeyed and cover a declared "
"subset of fields. SQLite WAL `synchronous=NORMAL` permits last-"
"transaction loss on power failure; no crash test or arbitrary-old-schema "
"migration was established. Checkpoint "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/operations/financial_operand_custody.py`),"
" attachment merge "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/attachment.py`), inventory "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/_inventory.py`), AEAD "
"context "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/review_package_recipient_encryption.py`),"
" [detail](../articles/020-encrypted-blobs-bucket-archives-and-custody-"
"filesystem.md), [detail](../articles/024-profile-custody-adapter-storage-"
"routing-and-secure-object-contracts.md)."
msgstr ""
"Els riscos delimitats inclouen escriptures directes in situ de punts de "
"control financers, una lectura, fusió i escriptura de manifests d’adjunts"
" potencialment subjecta a curses, contingut de base de dades omès de les "
"empremtes de l’inventari d’eliminació i metadades externes del paquet de "
"revisió absents de les dades associades AEAD d’aquest adaptador, pendents"
" de seguiment de signatures. Les empremtes de revisió SQL no tenen clau i"
" cobreixen un subconjunt declarat de camps. WAL de SQLite amb "
"`synchronous=NORMAL` permet perdre l’última transacció en una fallada "
"elèctrica; no es va establir cap prova de fallada ni migració d’esquemes "
"antics arbitraris. Punt de control "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/operations/financial_operand_custody.py`),"
" fusió d’adjunts "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/attachment.py`), inventari "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/_inventory.py`), "
"context AEAD "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/review_package_recipient_encryption.py`),"
" [detall](../articles/020-encrypted-blobs-bucket-archives-and-custody-"
"filesystem.md), [detall](../articles/024-profile-custody-adapter-storage-"
"routing-and-secure-object-contracts.md)."

#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md:16
msgid ""
"These are persistence-layer observations. A caller's journal, lock, "
"signature verification or recovery step may narrow the practical impact; "
"each path needs its full composition traced before it is described as an "
"end-to-end failure. The stated confidentiality guarantees also rely on "
"native key-store and filesystem permissions outside these SQL adapters."
msgstr ""
"Són observacions de la capa de persistència. El diari, bloqueig, "
"verificació de signatura o pas de recuperació d’un cridador poden "
"limitar-ne l’impacte pràctic; cal seguir la composició completa de cada "
"via abans de descriure-la com una fallada d’extrem a extrem. Les "
"garanties de confidencialitat declarades també depenen del magatzem natiu"
" de claus i dels permisos del sistema de fitxers fora d’aquests "
"adaptadors SQL."

#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md:22
msgid "Storage model and capability"
msgstr "Model d’emmagatzematge i capacitat"

#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md:24
msgid ""
"Private product state is primarily stored as profile-bound encrypted "
"secure objects in SQLite, with separate filesystem custody for profile "
"key capsules, attachments, archives, native secret handles and durable "
"operation journals. Namespace definitions declare owner, sensitivity, "
"schema and custody/mirror policy. A `BucketSession` retains one profile "
"DEK, deadlines and a bucket-routed database engine; closing it wipes its "
"mutable key buffer and disposes the engine. SQL rows use HMAC-addressed "
"object identities and AES-GCM associated data for namespace, key digest "
"and schema version. The database also has a plaintext, rebuildable "
"transaction date index containing routing dates and record IDs; missing "
"or incomplete index rows trigger encrypted-scan fallback, so it is "
"metadata with a different confidentiality posture from the transaction "
"content. Namespace registry "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/secure_object_namespaces.py`),"
" bucket session "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/master_key/bucket_session.py`),"
" SQL row model (`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/sql/orm.py`), "
"date fallback "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/transactions.py`), "
"[analyses](../articles/019-profile-persistence-for-transactions-review-"
"exchange-and-workflows.md), [analysis](../articles/023-profile-custody-"
"primitives-session-state-and-secure-envelopes.md), "
"[analysis](../articles/024-profile-custody-adapter-storage-routing-and-"
"secure-object-contracts.md), [analysis](../articles/025-encrypted-sql-"
"repository-revision-writes-and-workflow-storage.md)."
msgstr ""
"L’estat privat del producte s’emmagatzema principalment com a objectes "
"segurs xifrats vinculats al perfil a SQLite, amb custòdia separada al "
"sistema de fitxers per a càpsules de claus del perfil, adjunts, arxius, "
"identificadors natius de secrets i diaris duradors d’operacions. Les "
"definicions d’espais de noms declaren propietari, sensibilitat, esquema i"
" política de custòdia i rèplica. Una `BucketSession` conserva una DEK de "
"perfil, terminis i un motor de base de dades encaminat al contenidor; en "
"tancar-la s’esborra el buffer mutable de la clau i s’allibera el motor. "
"Les files SQL utilitzen identitats d’objecte adreçades amb HMAC i dades "
"associades AES-GCM per a l’espai de noms, l’empremta de clau i la versió "
"d’esquema. La base de dades també té un índex reconstruïble de dates de "
"transacció en text pla que conté dates d’encaminament i identificadors de"
" registre; les files d’índex absents o incompletes activen l’alternativa "
"d’escaneig xifrat, de manera que són metadades amb una postura de "
"confidencialitat diferent del contingut de les transaccions. Registre "
"d’espais de noms "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/secure_object_namespaces.py`),"
" sessió del contenidor "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/master_key/bucket_session.py`),"
" model de files SQL "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/sql/orm.py`), alternativa de "
"dates (`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/transactions.py`), "
"[anàlisis](../articles/019-profile-persistence-for-transactions-review-"
"exchange-and-workflows.md), [anàlisi](../articles/023-profile-custody-"
"primitives-session-state-and-secure-envelopes.md), "
"[anàlisi](../articles/024-profile-custody-adapter-storage-routing-and-"
"secure-object-contracts.md), [anàlisi](../articles/025-encrypted-sql-"
"repository-revision-writes-and-workflow-storage.md)."

#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md:26
msgid ""
"The secure-object write funnel validates registered "
"namespace/classification, encrypts payloads with identity AAD, derives "
"deterministic revision IDs, checks expected revisions and commits batch "
"writes/deletions with read assertions in one SQL transaction. Profile "
"repositories use those revisions for compare-and-swap mutations, parent "
"validation and related event co-commits. Invoice creation joins catalogue"
" and bucket event; calculation revisions are validated against pinned "
"authority and work units; verification reports require their calculation "
"parent; official and pending-local observations remain separate layers; "
"withholding windows co-commit head, generation, idempotency and source-"
"liability guards. The transaction catalogue encrypts individual rows plus"
" membership index, and checks its plaintext date route against that "
"encrypted membership before trusting it. These mechanisms reduce lost "
"updates and misleading cross-record reads, though actual isolation and "
"crash behavior were not exercised. SQL writes "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/sql/_secure_object_writes.py`),"
" invoice co-commit "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/catalogue_creation.py`), "
"verification parent "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/modelos_verification_reports.py`),"
" withholding workflow "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/withholding_observation_workflow.py`),"
" transaction catalogue "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/transactions.py`), "
"[analyses](../articles/017-persistence-for-llm-records-durable-"
"operations-and-profile-state.md), [analysis](../articles/018-profile-"
"persistence-for-invoices-filings-and-calculation-evidence.md), "
"[analysis](../articles/019-profile-persistence-for-transactions-review-"
"exchange-and-workflows.md), [analysis](../articles/025-encrypted-sql-"
"repository-revision-writes-and-workflow-storage.md)."
msgstr ""
"El conducte d’escriptura d’objectes segurs valida l’espai de noms i la "
"classificació registrats, xifra les càrregues útils amb AAD d’identitat, "
"deriva identificadors deterministes de revisió, comprova les revisions "
"esperades i confirma escriptures i eliminacions per lots amb assercions "
"de lectura en una única transacció SQL. Els repositoris de perfils "
"utilitzen aquestes revisions per a mutacions de comparació i intercanvi, "
"validació de pares i confirmacions conjuntes d’esdeveniments relacionats."
" La creació de factures uneix catàleg i esdeveniment del contenidor; les "
"revisions de càlcul es validen respecte de l’autoritat fixada i les "
"unitats de treball; els informes de verificació exigeixen el seu pare de "
"càlcul; les observacions oficials i les locals pendents continuen en "
"capes separades; les finestres de retencions confirmen conjuntament "
"capçalera, generació, idempotència i controls d’obligació de font. El "
"catàleg de transaccions xifra les files individuals i l’índex de "
"pertinença i comprova la ruta de dates en text pla respecte d’aquesta "
"pertinença xifrada abans de confiar-hi. Aquests mecanismes redueixen "
"actualitzacions perdudes i lectures enganyoses entre registres, tot i que"
" no es van exercitar l’aïllament real ni el comportament davant de "
"fallades. Escriptures SQL "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/sql/_secure_object_writes.py`),"
" confirmació conjunta de factures "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/catalogue_creation.py`), pare "
"de verificació "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/modelos_verification_reports.py`),"
" flux de retencions "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/withholding_observation_workflow.py`),"
" catàleg de transaccions "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/transactions.py`), "
"[anàlisis](../articles/017-persistence-for-llm-records-durable-"
"operations-and-profile-state.md), [anàlisi](../articles/018-profile-"
"persistence-for-invoices-filings-and-calculation-evidence.md), "
"[anàlisi](../articles/019-profile-persistence-for-transactions-review-"
"exchange-and-workflows.md), [anàlisi](../articles/025-encrypted-sql-"
"repository-revision-writes-and-workflow-storage.md)."

#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md:28
msgid ""
"An operation journal stores a credential-free current snapshot and "
"ordered history with contiguous sequence, monotonic timestamps and "
"terminal-state consistency. Leases share its lock and require exact "
"ownership for commits. Sensitive operation operands are stored separately"
" as content-addressed encrypted objects and re-hashed on resolution. LLM "
"cache, usage and run records occupy encrypted diagnostic namespaces with "
"age/count retention; the cache avoids persisting a redaction-altered "
"response. Off-host evidence consent history is different: it records "
"content address, provider/model, surface and time, appends before "
"dispatch and has no pruning path, because later withdrawal analysis needs"
" history. This is audit metadata, not a copy of transmitted bytes or "
"prompts. Journal validation "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/operations/_journal_validation.py`), "
"leases (`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/operations/lease.py`), operand "
"custody "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/operations/secure_references.py`), LLM"
" cache (`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/llm/cache.py`), consent ledger "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/llm/consent_ledger.py`), "
"[analysis](../articles/017-persistence-for-llm-records-durable-"
"operations-and-profile-state.md)."
msgstr ""
"Un diari d’operacions emmagatzema una instantània actual sense "
"credencials i un historial ordenat amb seqüència contigua, marques de "
"temps monòtones i coherència d’estat terminal. Els arrendaments "
"comparteixen el bloqueig i exigeixen titularitat exacta per a les "
"confirmacions. Els operands sensibles d’operacions s’emmagatzemen "
"separadament com a objectes xifrats adreçats pel contingut i se’n torna a"
" calcular l’empremta en resoldre’ls. La memòria cau LLM, l’ús i els "
"registres d’execució ocupen espais de noms diagnòstics xifrats amb "
"retenció per antiguitat i recompte; la memòria cau evita persistir una "
"resposta alterada per l’ocultació de dades. L’historial de consentiment "
"d’evidències fora de l’amfitrió és diferent: registra l’adreça de "
"contingut, el proveïdor i model, la superfície i el moment, afegeix "
"entrades abans de l’enviament i no té via de poda, perquè l’anàlisi "
"posterior de retirada necessita historial. Són metadades d’auditoria, no "
"una còpia dels bytes ni de les instruccions transmesos. Validació del "
"diari "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/operations/_journal_validation.py`), "
"arrendaments (`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/operations/lease.py`), "
"custòdia d’operands "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/operations/secure_references.py`), "
"memòria cau LLM (`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/llm/cache.py`), llibre"
" de consentiment "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/llm/consent_ledger.py`), "
"[anàlisi](../articles/017-persistence-for-llm-records-durable-operations-"
"and-profile-state.md)."

#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md:30
msgid "Key custody and recovery"
msgstr "Custòdia de claus i recuperació"

#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md:32
msgid ""
"Profile registration generates a DEK wrapped by a password-derived key "
"and writes an encrypted sentinel proving that an unwrapped key belongs to"
" the claimed profile and epoch. Recovery is optional and wraps the same "
"DEK under an independently derived, high-entropy code. KDF work runs in a"
" fresh supervised child with bounded frames, an Argon2id parameter grid, "
"pre-secret readiness attestation and process/resource containment; "
"malformed or timed-out work has no in-process fallback. Capsules are "
"staged as complete sibling directories, write a commit marker last, then "
"publish with a no-replace rename. Discovery accepts only canonical UUID "
"directories and current markers; retired plaintext layouts are refused. "
"Rotation requires a direct predecessor and same DEK epoch; deletion uses "
"a transaction marker, tombstone and inventory witness. "
"Registration/recovery "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/profile_custody.py`), sentinel"
" "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/sentinel_contract.py`),"
" KDF worker "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/_kdf_worker.py`), "
"capsule publication "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/capsule.py`), rotation"
" (`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/capsule.py`), "
"[analyses](../articles/020-encrypted-blobs-bucket-archives-and-custody-"
"filesystem.md), [analysis](../articles/021-supervised-key-derivation-and-"
"automation-custody.md), [analysis](../articles/022-profile-capsule-"
"lifecycle-and-custody-proof.md), [analysis](../articles/023-profile-"
"custody-primitives-session-state-and-secure-envelopes.md), "
"[analysis](../articles/024-profile-custody-adapter-storage-routing-and-"
"secure-object-contracts.md)."
msgstr ""
"El registre de perfils genera una DEK embolcallada amb una clau derivada "
"de contrasenya i escriu un sentinella xifrat que prova que una clau "
"desembolcallada pertany al perfil i l’època declarats. La recuperació és "
"opcional i embolcalla la mateixa DEK sota un codi d’alta entropia derivat"
" independentment. El treball KDF s’executa en un procés fill supervisat "
"nou amb trames delimitades, una graella de paràmetres Argon2id, "
"acreditació de preparació prèvia als secrets i contenció de processos i "
"recursos; el treball mal format o amb temps esgotat no té alternativa "
"dins del procés. Les càpsules es preparen com a directoris germans "
"complets, escriuen un marcador de confirmació al final i després es "
"publiquen amb un canvi de nom sense substitució. La descoberta accepta "
"només directoris UUID canònics i marcadors actuals; els dissenys retirats"
" en text pla es refusen. La rotació exigeix un predecessor directe i la "
"mateixa època DEK; l’eliminació utilitza un marcador de transacció, una "
"marca d’eliminació i un testimoni d’inventari. Registre i recuperació "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/profile_custody.py`), "
"sentinella "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/sentinel_contract.py`),"
" procés de treball KDF "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/_kdf_worker.py`), "
"publicació de càpsules "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/capsule.py`), rotació "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/capsule.py`), "
"[anàlisis](../articles/020-encrypted-blobs-bucket-archives-and-custody-"
"filesystem.md), [anàlisi](../articles/021-supervised-key-derivation-and-"
"automation-custody.md), [anàlisi](../articles/022-profile-capsule-"
"lifecycle-and-custody-proof.md), [anàlisi](../articles/023-profile-"
"custody-primitives-session-state-and-secure-envelopes.md), "
"[anàlisi](../articles/024-profile-custody-adapter-storage-routing-and-"
"secure-object-contracts.md)."

#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md:34
msgid ""
"Human login acceleration splits a random key in the OS keychain from an "
"encrypted receipt in the profile keystore, with authenticated "
"profile/session/generation/epoch/deadline metadata. Exact-byte journals "
"recover interrupted receipt swaps. Automation keys and grant wrapping "
"material use explicitly selected native secret stores, anchored control-"
"file publication and durable denial before optional native cleanup. The "
"design accepts the OS account as a trust boundary; it does not claim "
"defense against another equally privileged process. Memory wiping covers "
"mutable buffers, not all Python or native copies. The login throttle "
"intentionally fails open if its revocable local sidecar is missing or "
"corrupt, favoring availability over resistance to a local actor who can "
"disrupt it. Acceleration receipt "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/acceleration_receipt.py`),"
" automation store "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/automation_store.py`),"
" session close "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/master_key/bucket_session.py`),"
" throttle "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/master_key/login_throttle.py`),"
" [analyses](../articles/021-supervised-key-derivation-and-automation-"
"custody.md), [analysis](../articles/023-profile-custody-primitives-"
"session-state-and-secure-envelopes.md)."
msgstr ""
"L’acceleració de l’inici de sessió humà separa una clau aleatòria al "
"clauer del sistema operatiu d’un rebut xifrat al magatzem de claus del "
"perfil, amb metadades autenticades de perfil, sessió, generació, època i "
"termini. Els diaris de bytes exactes recuperen substitucions de rebuts "
"interrompudes. Les claus d’automatització i el material d’embolcall de "
"concessions utilitzen magatzems natius de secrets seleccionats "
"explícitament, publicació ancorada de fitxers de control i denegació "
"duradora abans de la neteja nativa opcional. El disseny accepta el compte"
" del sistema operatiu com a límit de confiança; no afirma defensar-se "
"d’un altre procés amb els mateixos privilegis. L’esborrament de memòria "
"cobreix els buffers mutables, no totes les còpies Python o natives. La "
"limitació d’inicis de sessió permet intencionadament l’accés si el fitxer"
" auxiliar local revocable és absent o corrupte, afavorint la "
"disponibilitat per damunt de la resistència a un actor local que el pugui"
" alterar. Rebut d’acceleració "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/acceleration_receipt.py`),"
" magatzem d’automatització "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/automation_store.py`),"
" tancament de sessió "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/master_key/bucket_session.py`),"
" limitació "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/master_key/login_throttle.py`),"
" [anàlisis](../articles/021-supervised-key-derivation-and-automation-"
"custody.md), [anàlisi](../articles/023-profile-custody-primitives-"
"session-state-and-secure-envelopes.md)."

#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md:36
msgid ""
"Attachments are encrypted content-addressed blobs with encrypted "
"manifests. Reads recheck bucket ownership, digest, size and row identity;"
" duplicate ingestion merges links. A separate filesystem blob store "
"encrypts non-CORPUS classifications and checks ciphertext and plaintext "
"digests. Portable archives have strict versioned members and staged "
"publication; archive data remains encrypted. These are real "
"confidentiality and integrity measures, with bounded exceptions: "
"attachment manifest merge reads before its optional writer fence and "
"passes no local revision witness, so caller serialization must prevent "
"concurrent lost links; a blob/manifest pair spans two files and can "
"become mismatched after sudden termination; the archive reader "
"materializes all tar members before rejecting a noncanonical member "
"count. Attachment store "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/attachment.py`), manifest "
"merge (`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/attachment.py`), blob "
"store "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/blob_store/blob_store.py`), "
"archive reader "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/bucket/sealed_archive_reader.py`),"
" [analysis](../articles/020-encrypted-blobs-bucket-archives-and-custody-"
"filesystem.md)."
msgstr ""
"Els adjunts són blocs binaris xifrats adreçats pel contingut amb "
"manifests xifrats. Les lectures tornen a comprovar la pertinença al "
"contenidor, l’empremta, la mida i la identitat de fila; la incorporació "
"duplicada fusiona enllaços. Un magatzem separat de blocs binaris al "
"sistema de fitxers xifra les classificacions que no són CORPUS i comprova"
" les empremtes del text xifrat i del text pla. Els arxius portables tenen"
" membres versionats estrictes i publicació preparada; les dades de "
"l’arxiu continuen xifrades. Són mesures reals de confidencialitat i "
"integritat, amb excepcions delimitades: la fusió de manifests d’adjunts "
"llegeix abans de la barrera opcional d’escriptura i no passa cap "
"testimoni local de revisió, de manera que la serialització del cridador "
"ha d’impedir la pèrdua concurrent d’enllaços; un parell de bloc binari i "
"manifest abasta dos fitxers i pot desajustar-se després d’una terminació "
"sobtada; el lector d’arxius materialitza tots els membres tar abans de "
"rebutjar un recompte no canònic de membres. Magatzem d’adjunts "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/attachment.py`), fusió de "
"manifests (`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/attachment.py`), "
"magatzem de blocs binaris "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/blob_store/blob_store.py`), "
"lector d’arxius "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/bucket/sealed_archive_reader.py`),"
" [anàlisi](../articles/020-encrypted-blobs-bucket-archives-and-custody-"
"filesystem.md)."

#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md:38
msgid "Scoped quality and assurance limits"
msgstr "Límits delimitats de qualitat i garantia"

#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md:40
msgid ""
"Several integrity boundaries deserve precise language. SQL revision IDs "
"are unkeyed hashes over a declared subset of columns; they detect "
"inconsistent rows but do not authenticate arbitrary database edits or "
"cover all ancestry/provenance metadata. Review-package recipient AEAD "
"locally binds the recipient key but not the outer expiry, replay nonce or"
" review-only flags; a higher-level signature may cover the envelope, so "
"impact requires tracing package verification. Financial-operand "
"checkpoints use direct in-place `write_text`, unlike the atomic journal "
"writer, and could be unreadable after interruption. Deletion inventory "
"binds ordinary custody file bytes but only database presence by path, "
"leaving concurrent database content changes outside its witness. The "
"secret store checks expiry presence on write but `get` does not itself "
"reject an expired value; consumer checks remain to be verified. Revision "
"coverage "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/sql/secure_object_crypto.py`),"
" recipient AEAD "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/review_package_recipient_encryption.py`),"
" checkpoint write "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/operations/financial_operand_custody.py`),"
" inventory "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/_inventory.py`), "
"secret-store get "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/secret_store/store.py`), "
"[analyses](../articles/017-persistence-for-llm-records-durable-"
"operations-and-profile-state.md), [analysis](../articles/019-profile-"
"persistence-for-transactions-review-exchange-and-workflows.md), "
"[analysis](../articles/020-encrypted-blobs-bucket-archives-and-custody-"
"filesystem.md), [analysis](../articles/024-profile-custody-adapter-"
"storage-routing-and-secure-object-contracts.md), "
"[analysis](../articles/025-encrypted-sql-repository-revision-writes-and-"
"workflow-storage.md)."
msgstr ""
"Diversos límits d’integritat mereixen un llenguatge precís. Els "
"identificadors de revisió SQL són empremtes sense clau sobre un "
"subconjunt declarat de columnes; detecten files incoherents, però no "
"autentiquen edicions arbitràries de la base de dades ni cobreixen totes "
"les metadades d’ascendència i procedència. L’AEAD del destinatari de "
"paquets de revisió vincula localment la clau del destinatari, però no la "
"caducitat externa, el nonce de reproducció ni els indicadors de només "
"revisió; una signatura de nivell superior pot cobrir l’embolcall, de "
"manera que l’impacte exigeix seguir la verificació del paquet. Els punts "
"de control d’operands financers utilitzen `write_text` directe in situ, a"
" diferència de l’escriptor atòmic de diaris, i podrien ser il·legibles "
"després d’una interrupció. L’inventari d’eliminació vincula els bytes "
"dels fitxers ordinaris de custòdia, però només la presència de la base de"
" dades per ruta, cosa que deixa els canvis concurrents del contingut de "
"la base de dades fora del testimoni. El magatzem de secrets comprova la "
"presència de caducitat en escriure, però `get` no rebutja per si mateix "
"un valor caducat; les comprovacions dels consumidors continuen pendents "
"de verificació. Cobertura de revisions "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/sql/secure_object_crypto.py`),"
" AEAD del destinatari "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/review_package_recipient_encryption.py`),"
" escriptura de punts de control "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/operations/financial_operand_custody.py`),"
" inventari "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/custody/_inventory.py`), "
"obtenció del magatzem de secrets "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/secret_store/store.py`), "
"[anàlisis](../articles/017-persistence-for-llm-records-durable-"
"operations-and-profile-state.md), [anàlisi](../articles/019-profile-"
"persistence-for-transactions-review-exchange-and-workflows.md), "
"[anàlisi](../articles/020-encrypted-blobs-bucket-archives-and-custody-"
"filesystem.md), [anàlisi](../articles/024-profile-custody-adapter-"
"storage-routing-and-secure-object-contracts.md), "
"[anàlisi](../articles/025-encrypted-sql-repository-revision-writes-and-"
"workflow-storage.md)."

#: ../../technical/topics/persistence-and-secure-storage.md:42
msgid ""
"SQLite uses WAL and `synchronous=NORMAL`, explicitly allowing loss of the"
" most recent transaction on OS/power failure while preserving database "
"integrity. `create_all` establishes current tables, not a proven upgrade "
"path for arbitrary older databases. Replay-nonce history is append-only "
"without expiry and can grow, while classified namespace/custody rules "
"govern which records can be mirrored or exported. Runtime tests, power-"
"loss recovery, native keychain behavior, cryptographic deployment and "
"current legal correctness were not established by this static review. "
"Engine settings "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/sql/engine.py`), replay nonce "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/recipient_replay_guard.py`), "
"namespace taxonomy "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/namespace_taxonomy.py`), "
"[analyses](../articles/018-profile-persistence-for-invoices-filings-and-"
"calculation-evidence.md), [analysis](../articles/025-encrypted-sql-"
"repository-revision-writes-and-workflow-storage.md)."
msgstr ""
"SQLite utilitza WAL i `synchronous=NORMAL`, que permeten explícitament "
"perdre la transacció més recent en una fallada del sistema operatiu o "
"elèctrica mentre conserven la integritat de la base de dades. "
"`create_all` estableix les taules actuals, no una via d’actualització "
"provada per a bases de dades antigues arbitràries. L’historial de nonces "
"de reproducció només permet afegir entrades, sense caducitat, i pot "
"créixer, mentre que les regles classificades d’espais de noms i custòdia "
"regeixen quins registres es poden replicar o exportar. Aquesta revisió "
"estàtica no va establir proves d’execució, recuperació de pèrdues "
"d’alimentació, comportament del clauer natiu, desplegament criptogràfic "
"ni correcció legal actual. Configuració del motor "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/sql/engine.py`), nonce de "
"reproducció "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/profile/recipient_replay_guard.py`), "
"taxonomia d’espais de noms "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/persistence/storage/namespace_taxonomy.py`), "
"[anàlisis](../articles/018-profile-persistence-for-invoices-filings-and-"
"calculation-evidence.md), [anàlisi](../articles/025-encrypted-sql-"
"repository-revision-writes-and-workflow-storage.md)."

